# One checkout, one line ending.
#
# This host has `core.autocrlf=true`, so `git add` warned about converting all 89 probe files
# and every `lib/*.js` from LF to CRLF. That matters more here than usual: the ledger's own
# probes hash and compare file bytes, `probes/utf8-check.mjs` asserts a strict UTF-8/no-BOM
# encoding for every tracked file, and a checkout that silently rewrote line endings would make
# those assertions disagree with the committed content for reasons nothing in the error says.
#
# Pinning `eol=lf` means the bytes in the repository are the bytes the probes see, on any host.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Probes and ledger fixtures are compared byte-for-byte; never normalise them on the way in.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary, if it ever appears: no conversion, no diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
